(
K04 force18 (2026-10-06): force_point is an external load along +force
(manual Professional 6.501). Unit quad4, E = 1, nu = 0, x fixed at
nodes 1 3, y fixed at nodes 1 2. force_point at (1, 0.5) with force
(2, 0): half to node 2 and half to node 4, a uniaxial bar with
sigxx = 2 and disx(2) = disx(4) = 2 (= Professional 02-08-2026).
GNU before K04: -2 (the force was subtracted from node_rhside).
Tolerance 1e-6: point_el() locates the point iteratively (EPS_SIZE
1e-6), GNU 1.999999902 vs Pro 2.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
